cmu-eex-rappel-tactical-hover-only = The EEX Rappel System can only be deployed during tactical hover.
cmu-eex-rappel-no-opening = The tile beneath the rappel system is not open.
cmu-eex-rappel-no-ground = There is no solid ground one level below the rappel system.
cmu-eex-rappel-blocked = Another ladder or rappel line is already occupying the deployment path.
cmu-eex-rappel-ground-blocked = A wall or other impassable structure blocks the rappel landing point.
